[I] GLib library exposing Qualcomm Sensor Core DSP sensors on Linux

[T] libssc is a GLib-based library that exposes sensors managed by Qualcomm's
[T] Sensor Core (SSC) digital signal processor to Linux userspace. It
[T] communicates with the DSP over QMI so applications can use hardware sensors
[T] without direct hardware access, which the hypervisor on these SoCs
[T] otherwise prohibits.

[U] https://codeberg.org/DylanVanAssche/libssc

[A] Dylan Van Assche
